{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_avroserializer", "label": "AvroSerializer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ships ready-made and takes a compiled avsc type you bring. It exists because avsc cannot decode a plain Uint8Array - fromBuffer reaches for Buffer-private methods - so a hand-rolled Avro serializer encodes fine and only fails on replay, on Bun, Node and Deno alike."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_protobufserializer", "label": "ProtobufSerializer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Takes a compiled protobufjs message type. It detaches Writer.finish()'s pooled bytes (which are otherwise a view onto other messages' memory), calls verify() so a wrong-typed field fails at write time naming the field, writes a manifest so foreign bytes cannot decode as plausible nonsense, and decodes toObject because a Message instance and a Long are not things a journal can store."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializer_id_allocation", "label": "Serializer id allocation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ids 1-99 are reserved for built-ins (JSON = 1, CBOR = 2) and the constructor rejects anything lower; the id is a wire contract embedded in every stored row, so changing it stops old rows decoding."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializer_manifest", "label": "Serializer manifest", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A string identifying the concrete type, used when one serializer handles several types or when a version must be verified on decode. Avro carries no field tags and Protobuf no message name, so the manifest is the only thing that refuses a payload written under a different schema."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_class_binding_registry", "label": "register and bind class routing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "register adds a serializer to the id lookup table, bind maps a constructor to an already-registered id (binding an unregistered id throws). Matching is by instanceof, so subclasses inherit the parent's binding and plain objects fall back to the default."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_messagepack_serializer_example", "label": "MessagePack serializer example", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A hand-written Serializer sitting between JSON (size, parse speed) and Protobuf (typed schemas), useful when a CBOR-like format with broader cross-language libraries is wanted."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serialized_row_framing", "label": "__serialized__ self-describing row framing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stores frame each row as id, manifest and base64 data, so rows written before a serializer was configured keep decoding through the default tagged-JSON codec and both formats coexist in one stream; reading a framed row needs a serializer with the same id or the read fails with a SerializationError naming it."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializercodec", "label": "serializerCodec", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "withSerializer is store-wide, one format for every payload the store writes, so per-event-version formats are expressed by adapting a Serializer into a SchemaRegistry per-version codec slot instead of instantiating the format twice."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_compiled_schema_over_proto_path", "label": "Compiled type instead of a .proto path", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Loading .proto at runtime would need filesystem access - unavailable in a browser, permission-gated on Deno, one more artifact to ship - so taking the compiled message type keeps source strings, bundled descriptors and generated static code all viable without forcing a build step."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_stateless_serializer_requirement", "label": "Serializers must be stateless", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "They may be shared across actors, called concurrently and instantiated fresh on restart, so mutable per-instance state is unsafe."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_in_memory_stores_ignore_serializer", "label": "In-memory stores ignore withSerializer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Their round-trip always uses the default codec, which is stricter than a custom serializer can be - the safe direction for a dev/test default."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_avroserializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_overview_serializer_interface", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_protobufserializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_overview_serializer_interface", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_messagepack_serializer_example", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_overview_serializer_interface", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_avroserializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializer_manifest", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_protobufserializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializer_manifest", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_avroserializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializer_id_allocation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_protobufserializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializer_id_allocation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_class_binding_registry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_overview_serialization_extension", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serialized_row_framing", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializer_id_allocation", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializercodec", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serialized_row_framing", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializercodec", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_avroserializer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serializercodec", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_protobufserializer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_compiled_schema_over_proto_path", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_protobufserializer", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_stateless_serializer_requirement", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_overview_serializer_interface", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_in_memory_stores_ignore_serializer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_serialized_row_framing", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_custom_class_binding_registry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_serialization_json_jsonserializer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/serialization/custom.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}